WEBVTT

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.753
"Misaki Station"

00:00:12.388 --> 00:00:14.140
Hey.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:15.725
You're late, moron.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:16.893
Sorry.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:20.479
I'm not the one you should say that to.

00:00:20.688 --> 00:00:21.814
Let's go.

00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:23.441
Yeah.

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:14.450
The vast black mirror in
the sky is named the Divine Gate.

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:17.536
It is the entrance
to a path created so that

00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:19.121
the Creator God,

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:22.333
the Snake of the Festival,
may return to this world.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:25.378
The Trinity and his current body

00:01:25.586 --> 00:01:27.338
are inside.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:30.841
L, the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed
Slayer and my comrades,

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.094
will go to stop him!

00:01:49.902 --> 00:01:51.320
Attack!

00:02:15.344 --> 00:02:18.973
<i>Now set free</i>

00:02:19.181 --> 00:02:25.354
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:02:25.563 --> 00:02:29.233
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:02:29.442 --> 00:02:35.281
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:37.825
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:02:38.034 --> 00:02:40.453
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:42.997
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:02:43.205 --> 00:02:47.877
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:02:48.085 --> 00:02:50.421
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:02:50.629 --> 00:02:53.090
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:53.299 --> 00:02:55.718
<i>Your existence</i>

00:02:55.926 --> 00:03:00.806
<i>Cry out</i>

00:03:01.015 --> 00:03:03.225
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.978
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:06.187 --> 00:03:08.564
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:03:08.773 --> 00:03:16.614
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:03:16.822 --> 00:03:23.204
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:39.095
Welcome back, Sato-kun.

00:03:39.303 --> 00:03:41.138
Yoshida-san?

00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:43.349
You could've waited inside.

00:03:44.392 --> 00:03:45.976
I told her...

00:03:46.185 --> 00:03:47.937
Since you'd run back,

00:03:48.145 --> 00:03:52.400
to come over and
see which of us arrived first.

00:03:52.608 --> 00:03:55.069
Just like I said, I won, right?

00:03:55.277 --> 00:03:56.237
Yes.

00:03:56.445 --> 00:03:58.447
What? Jeez...

00:04:03.202 --> 00:04:04.161
You aren't coming?

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.371
It's all right.

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:07.623
I was able to see
for myself that you're back.

00:04:07.832 --> 00:04:08.958
That's true.

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:12.044
I saw you here.
That's all I have to do.

00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:13.879
H-HeY--~...

00:04:15.047 --> 00:04:17.049
Did you come back for us?

00:04:17.258 --> 00:04:18.509
No, you didn't.

00:04:18.717 --> 00:04:19.885
But...

00:04:20.094 --> 00:04:21.637
You know how to

00:04:21.846 --> 00:04:24.306
wake a sleeping princess, right?

00:04:25.391 --> 00:04:26.308
Bye.

00:04:26.517 --> 00:04:29.520
Call us when she wakes up.

00:04:29.728 --> 00:04:31.730
O-Okay.

00:04:41.699 --> 00:04:44.660
"Feelings Heard"

00:05:00.718 --> 00:05:03.512
What are you doing?

00:05:03.721 --> 00:05:05.389
Marcosias...

00:05:05.598 --> 00:05:07.057
What are you doing here?

00:05:07.266 --> 00:05:08.309
What?

00:05:08.517 --> 00:05:12.021
I'm here because I heard
you were coming back.

00:05:12.229 --> 00:05:13.063
Why?

00:05:13.272 --> 00:05:16.192
I'm not interested in peeking.

00:05:19.278 --> 00:05:20.446
B-But...

00:05:20.654 --> 00:05:23.324
Isn't that why you returned?

00:05:23.532 --> 00:05:25.868
Well, yeah...

00:05:26.076 --> 00:05:29.622
Eita and the girl told you what happened.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.373
Some.

00:05:31.582 --> 00:05:33.876
Then, go.

00:05:34.084 --> 00:05:37.087
Stop making me run my mouth.

00:05:37.296 --> 00:05:38.506
Well, um...

00:05:38.714 --> 00:05:40.132
Go.

00:05:41.467 --> 00:05:42.885
Yes.

00:05:44.386 --> 00:05:47.097
Keisaku, when it's time to act cool,

00:05:47.306 --> 00:05:50.184
you can never act too cool.

00:05:50.392 --> 00:05:52.228
Good luck.

00:05:53.437 --> 00:05:56.273
Thank you, Marcosias.

00:05:59.735 --> 00:06:02.571
Once everything's well, tell me that.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.831
I'm back, Margery-san.

00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:25.094
Margery-san...

00:06:25.302 --> 00:06:27.846
I heard about everything that happened.

00:06:28.055 --> 00:06:31.100
Who the Silver you were hunting really was.

00:06:31.308 --> 00:06:33.769
And that to you,

00:06:33.978 --> 00:06:36.855
the centuries you spent
chasing him meant nothing.

00:06:38.065 --> 00:06:42.903
But they meant something to us.

00:06:43.112 --> 00:06:46.448
To Tanaka, Shana-chan,
Yoshida-san, and Oga-chan.

00:06:46.657 --> 00:06:49.243
To Sakai, too.

00:06:49.451 --> 00:06:50.578
And more than anyone,

00:06:50.786 --> 00:06:53.581
they meant something to me.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.793
No matter what anyone thinks of you...

00:06:58.002 --> 00:07:00.629
No matter what you think of yourself,

00:07:00.838 --> 00:07:06.677
the fact that you're
here means something to me.

00:07:06.885 --> 00:07:10.931
My entire existence is devoted

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.851
to keeping you alive.

00:07:17.021 --> 00:07:21.984
When I heard that you needed me,

00:07:22.192 --> 00:07:24.320
I was haPPY-

00:07:24.528 --> 00:07:26.905
That happiness told me...

00:07:27.948 --> 00:07:33.829
...that I really do live for your sake.

00:07:35.998 --> 00:07:38.459
Once you wake up,

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:41.670
that's the first thing I want to tell you.

00:07:53.223 --> 00:07:54.850
Marger--

00:07:58.937 --> 00:08:00.731
I heard it...

00:08:00.939 --> 00:08:02.775
Your voice.

00:08:07.321 --> 00:08:08.572
And I heard

00:08:08.781 --> 00:08:11.450
Eita and Kazumi's voices, too,

00:08:11.659 --> 00:08:14.078
when I learned the
truth and nearly fell apart.

00:08:14.286 --> 00:08:17.498
He hasn't done anything for you yet!

00:08:17.706 --> 00:08:22.127
You've been loved for a long time!

00:08:22.336 --> 00:08:23.754
It is true

00:08:23.962 --> 00:08:26.507
that I thought of you then.

00:08:26.715 --> 00:08:29.802
And I felt my feelings toward you.

00:08:31.512 --> 00:08:33.681
I was surprised that they were there.

00:08:33.889 --> 00:08:35.140
I doubted them.

00:08:35.349 --> 00:08:37.393
And then, I just didn't know...

00:08:38.852 --> 00:08:41.230
That's why I slept.

00:08:41.438 --> 00:08:42.856
Why?

00:08:44.274 --> 00:08:46.819
If they were real,

00:08:47.027 --> 00:08:49.947
then I could postpone annihilation,

00:08:50.155 --> 00:08:52.866
at least for a while.

00:08:53.075 --> 00:08:55.744
Until I could feel them more strongly.

00:08:55.953 --> 00:08:57.955
You felt it, didn't you?

00:08:59.373 --> 00:09:02.710
Enough to stave off annihilation.

00:09:02.918 --> 00:09:04.378
That's enough.

00:09:04.586 --> 00:09:06.714
It's more than enough.

00:09:06.922 --> 00:09:08.549
To me...

00:09:09.717 --> 00:09:10.759
Thank you...

00:09:10.968 --> 00:09:13.554
Or I suppose those words may
be an insult, Keisaku.

00:09:13.762 --> 00:09:15.806
It doesn't matter to me.

00:09:16.014 --> 00:09:18.976
Just having you here...

00:09:19.184 --> 00:09:20.894
That's not enough.

00:09:21.103 --> 00:09:23.021
So as a woman,

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:25.232
I ask you, as a man.

00:09:26.608 --> 00:09:28.235
Keisaku,

00:09:28.444 --> 00:09:31.488
I'm not interrogating
your devotion or your life.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.116
Do you love me?

00:09:34.324 --> 00:09:36.326
Yes! I do!

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:44.752
Do you remember?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:47.171
When I talked about how a Flame Haze

00:09:47.379 --> 00:09:50.799
is too strong to hold
someone as tightly as they can?

00:09:51.008 --> 00:09:52.426
Y-Yes.

00:09:56.764 --> 00:10:01.185
For a short while,
I can make you as strong as I am.

00:10:01.393 --> 00:10:03.896
But if I don't put that
kind of distance between us,

00:10:04.104 --> 00:10:06.064
I'll find myself getting closer to you.

00:10:07.024 --> 00:10:08.859
Right?

00:10:09.067 --> 00:10:12.946
That's how it's been until now...

00:10:14.364 --> 00:10:16.200
And now?

00:10:17.159 --> 00:10:19.244
Why not see for yourself?

00:10:54.404 --> 00:10:55.864
What's that?

00:10:56.073 --> 00:10:58.659
A bird that's not a bird.

00:10:58.867 --> 00:11:00.118
Indeed.

00:11:00.327 --> 00:11:04.331
It appears to be the Flame Hazes
who banished the Creator God

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.917
in the distant past.

00:11:09.419 --> 00:11:11.255
Are they telling us to follow?

00:11:11.463 --> 00:11:13.382
So it seems.

00:11:32.401 --> 00:11:34.695
The enemy army's disarray

00:11:34.903 --> 00:11:38.240
had turned the tide of battle toward us.

00:11:38.448 --> 00:11:39.992
The troops on the front lines

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.871
say that the fortress
guards have emerged.

00:11:44.079 --> 00:11:47.291
So they didn't expect an
attack on their main fortress,

00:11:47.499 --> 00:11:49.751
and left it ill-defended.

00:11:50.752 --> 00:11:53.714
Frangois, what's happening
in the surrounding area?

00:11:53.922 --> 00:11:56.216
Right. I'll see.

00:12:13.984 --> 00:12:15.694
From what's in my detection radius,

00:12:15.903 --> 00:12:18.488
a force approaches from the north.

00:12:18.697 --> 00:12:21.408
It's likely to be the
Ball Masque defensive forces,

00:12:21.617 --> 00:12:24.661
turning inward.

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.371
Closer, from the south,

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.166
another force approaches.

00:12:29.374 --> 00:12:31.585
Those troops aren't that numerous.

00:12:31.793 --> 00:12:33.879
We can defeat them, but...

00:12:34.087 --> 00:12:38.675
The problem is the two larger forces,
which have withdrawn, to the east and west.

00:12:38.884 --> 00:12:40.218
No matter how forced their march,

00:12:40.427 --> 00:12:43.013
I believe they cannot arrive before morning.

00:12:43.221 --> 00:12:49.019
Our own forces harass and
pursue the retreating troops, but...

00:12:49.227 --> 00:12:52.940
For now, we enjoy a temporary advantage.

00:12:53.148 --> 00:12:59.363
It will last only until the first
eastern or western army arrives.

00:13:01.365 --> 00:13:03.450
How much can we accomplish

00:13:03.659 --> 00:13:05.494
before time runs out?

00:13:09.122 --> 00:13:12.084
First, send half our reserves

00:13:12.292 --> 00:13:17.005
to aid those who fight near the Divine Gate.

00:13:17.214 --> 00:13:20.217
It need be merely
enough to occupy them.

00:13:20.425 --> 00:13:23.303
Our goal is to split the enemy forces.

00:13:23.512 --> 00:13:27.182
Samuel is to lead the
remaining half of our reserves,

00:13:27.391 --> 00:13:30.060
in an assault on the
Palace of the Stars.

00:13:30.268 --> 00:13:31.687
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:31.979 --> 00:13:32.896
Now, then.

00:13:33.105 --> 00:13:36.441
Both the Trinity and the Creator God

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.110
are absent from this battle.

00:13:38.318 --> 00:13:40.988
Let us inflict all the damage we can.

00:13:57.754 --> 00:14:00.632
We lack the necessary troops.

00:14:00.841 --> 00:14:03.844
But the Palace of the
Stars guards our greatest secrets.

00:14:04.052 --> 00:14:08.348
It must not fall into enemy
hands even for an instant.

00:14:08.557 --> 00:14:09.599
Thus,

00:14:09.808 --> 00:14:14.271
I must at least buy time
until the nearby forces arrive.

00:14:15.522 --> 00:14:19.276
Had the western forces on their way,

00:14:19.484 --> 00:14:22.571
and their commander,
Burning Agitation Haborym, arrived,

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:26.033
there would be no problem.

00:14:26.241 --> 00:14:30.662
But we do not have
enough to last the short time

00:14:30.871 --> 00:14:32.664
until his arrival.

00:14:32.873 --> 00:14:35.459
I have no choice, then.

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:48.388
This is...

00:14:48.597 --> 00:14:51.058
The source of the vibrations is moving!

00:14:52.893 --> 00:14:54.394
Impossible!

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:19.252
Decarabia?

00:15:19.461 --> 00:15:21.922
To stand at the front of his troops...

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.757
That's unlike him.

00:15:27.886 --> 00:15:29.304
What?

00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:50.659
It seems that directly attacking
Decarabia does no damage!

00:15:50.867 --> 00:15:55.664
And attacks that were effective
against the Denizens no longer work!

00:15:56.998 --> 00:15:59.626
He's used an Unrestricted Method
of teleportation on his own body,

00:15:59.835 --> 00:16:01.294
to deflect attack.

00:16:01.503 --> 00:16:05.966
And he's using defensive spells
on the Denizens on the battlefield.

00:16:06.174 --> 00:16:09.803
Those simple Unrestricted
Methods don't work on groups.

00:16:10.011 --> 00:16:12.472
He's cast them on each individual?

00:16:12.681 --> 00:16:14.641
Madness...

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.853
He, himself, must have appeared,

00:16:18.061 --> 00:16:21.773
to cast so many Unrestricted
Methods on a battlefield.

00:16:21.982 --> 00:16:23.608
But this is...

00:16:24.192 --> 00:16:28.405
He's abandoned any intent
of prolonging the battle.

00:16:28.613 --> 00:16:30.073
He isn't giving up.

00:16:30.282 --> 00:16:33.118
He's taking a calculated risk.

00:16:34.494 --> 00:16:37.080
He's so short on forces,

00:16:37.289 --> 00:16:39.457
he's willing to sacrifice his own life?

00:16:39.666 --> 00:16:42.794
Or perhaps reinforcements are close enough

00:16:43.003 --> 00:16:46.298
that he need only hold the line for a bit?

00:16:50.969 --> 00:16:55.515
It seems I must not hold
my power in reserve, either!

00:16:57.767 --> 00:16:59.477
We'll concentrate
our attacks on a single point.

00:16:59.686 --> 00:17:02.439
We build a bridge, a single road above.

00:17:02.647 --> 00:17:04.691
Understood, Zirnitra?

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.527
We build a bridge, a single road above.

00:17:07.736 --> 00:17:09.154
Establishing.

00:17:09.362 --> 00:17:12.365
Begin the operation, Demantius.

00:17:16.119 --> 00:17:19.456
Disrupt! Strike... Build.

00:17:19.664 --> 00:17:21.208
Thy name is honor...

00:17:21.416 --> 00:17:24.085
...Hill of Ziika!

00:17:50.403 --> 00:17:52.864
All forces, form ranks!

00:17:54.449 --> 00:17:56.910
Ready“.

00:17:57.118 --> 00:17:58.536
Charge!

00:18:09.631 --> 00:18:12.217
The blizzard has stopped?

00:18:20.058 --> 00:18:23.645
With my vision restored,
targeting them will be simple.

00:18:27.148 --> 00:18:29.859
I'll only have time for a single strike.

00:18:30.068 --> 00:18:33.446
Thus, that one strike will be as powerful

00:18:33.655 --> 00:18:35.490
as I can make it.

00:18:40.412 --> 00:18:42.247
I've found you!

00:18:45.208 --> 00:18:48.795
Daaaraassshaa!

00:19:29.627 --> 00:19:30.962
Well done.

00:19:31.171 --> 00:19:33.465
But don't you think you
used too much of your power?

00:19:33.673 --> 00:19:35.967
But it was worth it.

00:19:36.176 --> 00:19:38.053
Now Samuel's charge...

00:19:38.261 --> 00:19:40.597
C-Commander Sawallisch!

00:19:40.805 --> 00:19:43.058
A massive force has suddenly appeared

00:19:43.266 --> 00:19:45.268
on our western flank!

00:19:46.102 --> 00:19:48.563
We kept a careful watch!

00:20:00.617 --> 00:20:02.535
Those flames...

00:20:05.413 --> 00:20:07.374
Haborym, the Burning Agitation.

00:20:07.582 --> 00:20:09.542
Their western forces

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:13.046
have returned so quickly?

00:20:13.254 --> 00:20:17.675
That flock of birds was an
Unrestricted Method of concealment?

00:20:17.884 --> 00:20:19.677
We've been fooled.

00:20:19.886 --> 00:20:21.346
Enemy reinforcements!

00:20:21.554 --> 00:20:22.222
Oh, no...

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.682
They're right on our flank!

00:20:25.725 --> 00:20:29.104
The time has come,
earlier than we expected.

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:35.527
Margery-sen?!

00:20:35.735 --> 00:20:37.153
What?

00:20:39.114 --> 00:20:40.657
Look at your face...

00:20:40.865 --> 00:20:42.700
I-I'm sorry.

00:20:42.909 --> 00:20:46.329
I read what you brought me...

00:20:46.538 --> 00:20:48.248
Sophie's plans.

00:20:48.456 --> 00:20:51.709
Calm. Crossing. And Ebb.

00:20:51.918 --> 00:20:53.420
Yes...

00:20:53.628 --> 00:20:55.922
You get ready, too.

00:20:56.131 --> 00:20:57.549
We're leaving.

00:20:58.675 --> 00:21:01.052
You're coming with me, right?

00:21:02.804 --> 00:21:04.556
I see, centered on the hidden Rinne,

00:21:04.556 --> 00:21:08.059
<i>I must be dreaming tonight.</i>

00:21:08.059 --> 00:21:09.227
Unrestricted Methods
placed on the fortress ahead.

00:21:09.227 --> 00:21:13.606
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:13.606 --> 00:21:15.066
And the last is one I don't recognize.

00:21:15.066 --> 00:21:15.316
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:15.316 --> 00:21:19.737
That totals twelve defenses
in our path, indeed.

00:21:19.737 --> 00:21:20.822
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:20.822 --> 00:21:21.448
As usual, their goal is...

00:21:21.656 --> 00:21:22.657
...delay progress.

00:21:22.866 --> 00:21:23.992
Yeah.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.370
But your inability to recognize
that Unrestricted Method is worrisome.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:30.206
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:21:30.206 --> 00:21:31.082
We should start with all caution.

00:21:31.082 --> 00:21:31.666
<i>Close your eyes</i>

00:21:31.666 --> 00:21:34.627
But that judge's eye
of yours is convenient.

00:21:34.627 --> 00:21:35.837
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:21:35.837 --> 00:21:37.714
I'd like to swap it with mine,
which only breaks stuff.

00:21:37.714 --> 00:21:38.047
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:21:38.047 --> 00:21:38.590
Ow...

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:43.636
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:43.636 --> 00:21:44.095
Shut up.

00:21:45.763 --> 00:21:49.809
<i>“I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:57.859 --> 00:22:00.820
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:01.029 --> 00:22:04.407
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.616 --> 00:22:07.577
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.785 --> 00:22:13.541
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:14.834
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.043 --> 00:22:18.129
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.338 --> 00:22:21.466
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.674 --> 00:22:24.886
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.094 --> 00:22:28.264
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.473 --> 00:22:31.601
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:31.809 --> 00:22:34.979
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.188 --> 00:22:38.900
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.108 --> 00:22:41.819
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.028 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.576 --> 00:22:50.078
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.286 --> 00:22:51.329
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.538 --> 00:22:53.289
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:22:56.918
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.126 --> 00:23:00.255
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.463 --> 00:23:03.675
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:03.883 --> 00:23:06.719
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:06.928 --> 00:23:10.473
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.682 --> 00:23:13.601
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:22.318
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:25.822 --> 00:23:28.408
Shana leaves Wilhelmina
and the rest to fight Sabrac,

00:23:28.616 --> 00:23:30.326
and chases after Yuji.

00:23:30.535 --> 00:23:32.954
But Hecate's ritual begins,

00:23:33.162 --> 00:23:36.124
and the Path of Pilgrimage resounds
with the Snake of the Festival's body's cry.

00:23:36.332 --> 00:23:38.626
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.835 --> 00:23:39.794
"Words of a Vow."
